"short-term on this site."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:77
msgid "阿里云对象存储 OSS"
msgstr "Aliyun Object Storage OSS"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:78
msgid "阿里云"
msgstr "Aliyun"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:79
msgid "验证对象存储写入连接，或将 WordPress 媒体文件上传到管理员选择的对象存储"
msgstr ""
"Validate object storage write connection, or upload WordPress media files to"
" the object storage selected by the admin."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:80
msgid "管理员选择阿里云并主动运行连接测试时，或启用对象存储并在之后上传媒体文件时"
msgstr ""
"When the admin selects Aliyun and runs a connection test, or when object "
"storage is enabled and media files are uploaded afterward."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:81
msgid "连接测试文本或媒体文件内容、含可选目录前缀的对象路径、Bucket、阿里云 Endpoint、AccessKey 标识和签名请求头"
msgstr ""
"Connection test text or media file content, including optional directory "
"prefix in the object path, Bucket, Aliyun Endpoint, AccessKey identifier, "
"and signature request header."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:82
msgid ""
"已保存的 AccessKey、SecretKey、Bucket、上传目录、Endpoint 与公开访问地址存在本站 WordPress "
"数据库；未保存的凭据草稿只用于当次测试。测试对象保留在 Bucket 的可选目录下，重复测试会覆盖同名对象"
msgstr ""
"Saved AccessKey, SecretKey, Bucket, upload directory, Endpoint, and public "
"access address exist in this site's WordPress database; draft credentials "
"for un-saved credentials are only used for this test. Test objects will be "
"retained under the optional directory within the Bucket, and repeated tests "
"will overwrite existing objects."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:83
msgid "腾讯云对象存储 COS"
msgstr "Tencent Cloud Object Storage COS"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:84
msgid "腾讯云"
msgstr "Tencent Cloud"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:85
msgid "管理员选择腾讯云并主动运行连接测试时，或启用对象存储并在之后上传媒体文件时"
msgstr ""
"When the admin selects Tencent Cloud and runs a connection test, or when "
"object storage is enabled and media files are uploaded afterward."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:86
msgid "连接测试文本或媒体文件内容、含可选目录前缀的对象路径、Bucket/Region、AccessKey 标识和签名请求头"
msgstr ""
"Connection test text or media file content, the object path with an optional"
" directory prefix, Bucket/Region, AccessKey identifier, and signed request "
"headers."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:87
msgid ""
"已保存的 AccessKey、SecretKey、Bucket、上传目录、Region 与公开访问地址存在本站 WordPress "
"数据库；未保存的凭据草稿只用于当次测试。测试对象保留在 Bucket 的可选目录下，重复测试会覆盖同名对象"
msgstr ""
"Saved AccessKey, SecretKey, Bucket, upload directory, Region, and public "
"access address exist in this site's WordPress database; draft credentials "
"for un-saved credentials are only used for this test. Test objects will be "
"retained under the optional directory within the Bucket, and repeated tests "
"will overwrite existing objects."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:88
msgid "七牛云对象存储 Kodo"
msgstr "Qiniu Cloud Object Storage Kodo"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:89
msgid "七牛云"
msgstr "Qiniu Cloud"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:90
msgid "管理员选择七牛云并主动运行连接测试时，或启用对象存储并在之后上传媒体文件时"
msgstr ""
"When the admin selects Qiniu Cloud and runs a connection test, or when "
"object storage is enabled and media files are uploaded afterward."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:91
msgid "连接测试文本或媒体文件内容、含可选目录前缀的对象路径、Bucket、AccessKey 标识和上传凭证"
msgstr ""
"Connection test text or media file content, including optional directory "
"prefix in the object path, Bucket, AccessKey identifier, and upload "
"credential."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:92
msgid ""
"已保存的 AccessKey、SecretKey、Bucket、上传目录与公开访问地址存在本站 WordPress "
"数据库；未保存的凭据草稿只用于当次测试。测试对象保留在 Bucket 的可选目录下，重复测试会覆盖同名对象"
msgstr ""
"Saved AccessKey, SecretKey, Bucket, Upload Directory and Public Access "
"Address exist in the WordPress database; un-saved credential drafts are only"
" used for current testing."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:93
msgid "百度"
msgstr "Baidu"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:94
msgid "在站点前台加载百度统计脚本"
msgstr "Load Baidu Analytics script on site front-end page"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:95
msgid "管理员启用百度统计模块并保存非空站点 ID 后，访客打开前台页面时"
msgstr ""
"Admin enables Baidu Analytics module after saving non-empty site ID, "
"visitors will see the analytics script when opening a front-end page."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:96
msgid "访客浏览器会向百度发送 IP 地址、User-Agent、Referrer、页面 URL 以及百度统计脚本按其政策处理的访问数据"
msgstr ""
"Visitor's browser sends visitor's IP address, User-Agent, Referrer, URL and "
"access data processed by Baidu according to its policy to Baidu."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:97
msgid "百度统计站点 ID 存在本站 WordPress 数据库"
msgstr "Baidu Analytics site ID exists in the WordPress database."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:98
msgid "Loli.net 国内资源镜像"
msgstr "Loli.net Domestic Resource Mirror"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:99
msgid ""
"把 Gravatar、Google Fonts 和 Google Hosted Libraries 资源 URL 替换为 "
"gravatar.loli.net、fonts.loli.net、gstatic.loli.net 或 "
"ajax.loli.net；也支持管理员自定义目标"
msgstr ""
"Replace Gravatar, Google Fonts and Google Hosted Libraries resource URLs "
"with gravatar.loli.net, fonts.loli.net, gstatic.loli.net or ajax.loli.net; "
"also supports administrator-defined targets."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:100
msgid "管理员启用 CDN 替换总开关及对应子项后，访客页面需要相关资源时"
msgstr ""
"After enabling CDN replacement total switch and corresponding sub-items in "
"maintenance tools, visitor pages need to send request resource URL, IP "
"address and standard HTTP headers when needing related resources."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:101
msgid "访客浏览器向镜像发送请求资源 URL、IP 地址及标准 HTTP 请求头；Gravatar 请求还包含头像哈希"
msgstr ""
"The mirror sends the requested resource URL, visitor's IP address and "
"standard HTTP headers; Gravatar requests also include avatar hash."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:102
msgid "镜像地址和自定义替换规则存在本站 WordPress 数据库"
msgstr ""
"Mirror addresses and custom replacement rules exist in the WordPress "
"database."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:103
msgid "国内访问连通性检测"
msgstr "Domestic Connectivity Test"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:104
msgid "Google、Automattic（Gravatar）与 WordPress.org"
msgstr "Google, Automattic (Gravatar) and WordPress.org"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:105
msgid ""
"检测服务器能否访问 Google Fonts、Google Hosted Libraries、Gravatar 和 WordPress.org API"
msgstr ""
"Test whether server can access Google Fonts, Google Hosted Libraries, "
"Gravatar and WordPress.org API"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:106
msgid "具有管理权限的管理员在维护工具中主动运行检测时"
msgstr ""
"When an administrator with management permissions runs the test in "
"maintenance tools actively"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:107
msgid "不发送站点内容或插件配置；各服务可收到服务器 IP、目标 URL 和标准 HTTP 请求头"
msgstr ""
"Does not send site content or plugin configurations; each service can "
"receive server IP, target URL and standard HTTP headers."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:108
msgid "检测可达性与延迟结果在本站缓存一小时"
msgstr "Check accessibility and latency results in site cache for one hour"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:109
msgid "Google Search Console 站点验证"
msgstr "Google Search Console Site Verification"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:110
msgid "输出管理员提供的站点验证 meta 标签"
msgstr "Output the site verification meta tag provided by the administrator"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:111
msgid "管理员启用模块并保存非空验证码后"
msgstr "Admin enables modules and saves a non-empty captcha after it"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:112
msgid "无；插件只输出 meta 标签，不主动请求 Google"
msgstr ""
"No; the plugin only outputs meta tags and does not actively request Google."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:113
msgid "站点验证码存在本站 WordPress 数据库"
msgstr "Site CAPTCHA exists in this WordPress database"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:114
msgid "Bing Webmaster Tools 站点验证"
msgstr "Site Verification - Bing Webmaster Tools"

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:115
msgid "无；插件只输出 meta 标签，不主动请求 Microsoft"
msgstr ""
"No; the plugin only outputs meta tags and does not actively request "
"Microsoft."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:116 admin/partials/privacy/index.php:194
msgid "本插件默认不收集用户个人身份信息。所有配置数据存储在 WordPress 数据库内。"
msgstr ""
"This plugin does not collect any user personal information by default. All "
"configuration data is stored in the WordPress database."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:117 admin/partials/privacy/index.php:195
msgid "部分功能需要连接第三方服务，具体触发条件、数据流向及服务条款见上方服务列表。"
msgstr ""
"Some features require connecting to third-party services. See the service "
"list above for specific triggers, data flow, and terms of service."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:118 admin/partials/privacy/index.php:196
msgid "所有列出的出站连接都需要管理员明确启用相关功能或主动运行检测；插件默认不向开发者发送遥测。"
msgstr ""
"All outbound links listed require explicit activation of related features or"
" running a scan by an administrator; the plugin does not send telemetry to "
"developers by default."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:119 admin/partials/privacy/index.php:197
msgid ""
"已保存凭据存储在 WordPress "
"数据库中，仅在管理员启用对应功能或主动运行对象存储连接测试时用于服务端鉴权请求；未保存的对象存储凭据草稿只用于当次测试。插件不会把凭据发送给开发者。"
msgstr ""
"Credentials are saved in the WordPress database and used for server "
"authentication requests when the corresponding feature is enabled by an "
"administrator or during a storage connection test; unsaved object storage "
"credentials only apply to this one-time test. The plugin does not send "
"credentials to developers."

#: vite/admin/dist/index.js:120 admin/partials/privacy/index.php:198
msgid ""
"卸载会清理插件设置、计划任务、临时缓存、评论拦截标记及纯运行态附件标记，但不会删除或改写媒体文件、文章、评论、分类或远端对象。已转换附件的 WebP "
"恢复记录会保留，避免失去恢复原 JPEG 所需的信息；如需由插件执行恢复，请在卸载前完成。"
msgstr ""
"Uninstalling will clean plugin settings, scheduled tasks, temporary cache, "
"comment blocking flags, and pristine attachment flags, but it won't delete "
"or rewrite media files, posts, comments, categories, or remote objects. WebP"
" recovery records for converted attachments will be retained to avoid losing"
" the information needed to restore from JPEG; if you need the plugin to "
"perform a restoration, do so before uninstalling."

